- `filter()` (cache.py ~2656): reindexes `_overlap_carry_valid` and `_overlap_windows_this_call` by `idx_list`, and fancy-indexes both carry tensors by `batch_indices` — same surviving-set/same-order semantics as the existing per-stream lists.
